WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.860
Call your surgeon or clinic staff if all three signs

2
00:00:04.913 --> 00:00:05.900
below are present.

3
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.860
The incision is red and swollen.

4
00:00:09.153 --> 00:00:10.700
It does not get better

5
00:00:10.748 --> 00:00:12.620
over the next one to two days.

6
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:14.860
It hurts when touched.
